  "question": {
    "text": "A chain is placed on a rough table, partially hanging, as shown in the figure. The coefficient of static friction between the chain and the table is&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.4</mn><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;If the maximum possible length of the hanging part is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;and the length of the chain is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi></math>, then what is the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>L</mi><mi>x</mi></mfrac></math>?<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/Phys_jee_solu_2.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 114px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3.5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "If <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo></math> length suspended<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;(mass of hanging part)<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>)</mo></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; (mass of the part kept on the table)<br /><br />Then for balance,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0.4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mn>1.4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mi>L</mi><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>.4</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.4</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math>",
